  "download_disabled": false,
  "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\">This data-set is post-processed from two Perturb-seq experiments - one genome-wide screen and another targeted screen - conducted in multiple iPSC lines, described in (https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.1101/2024.11.28.625833v1). The following data summaries are available:</p><ul><li><b>[Genome-wide screen]</b> Mean transcriptional fold-change per targets and expressed gene.</li><li><b>[Genome-wide screen]</b> Mean transcriptional fold-change per guide and expressed gene.</li><li><b>[Genome-wide screen]</b> Co-regulation (R2) of targets.</li><li><b>[Genome-wide screen]</b> Co-perturbation (R2) of expressed genes.</li><li><b>[Targeted screen]</b> Mean transcriptional fold-change per target across cell lines, per expressed gene.</li><li><b>[Targeted screen]</b> Mean transcriptional fold-change per guide across cell lines, per expressed gene.</li><li><b>[Targeted screen]</b> Mean transcriptional fold-change per target, per cell line, per expressed gene.</li></ul><p></p>",
